        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "凭 introduces a resource, qualification or evidence relied on to act. It identifies a basis, not an intended purpose.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "凭票进。",
                "pinyin": "píng piào jìn 。",
                "meaning": "Enter with a ticket.",
                "audio": "eafc335215cc73c22c39ef76fec3939569983ef33035b9a9bfe81e0b230dd705"
              },
              {
                "text": "你凭什么这样说？",
